<Base title="Terms of Service">
  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>

  <h2>The service</h2>
  <p>
    Buku Latihan is a free educational service that lets students practice
    exercises and past-year papers, teachers manage classrooms and marking,
    and parents follow their children's progress.
  </p>

  <h2>Your account</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      You are responsible for keeping your password confidential. Two-factor
      authentication is available and recommended.
    </li>
    <li>
      You must provide accurate information and use the service lawfully.
    </li>
    <li>You may delete your account at any time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No harassment, abuse, or unlawful content.</li>
    <li>No attempts to access other users' accounts or data.</li>
    <li>No automated scraping or abuse of the API.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Content</h2>
  <p>
    You retain ownership of the work you submit. You grant us the limited
    permission needed to store, process, and display it to you, your teachers,
    and linked parents as the service requires.
  </p>

  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>
    The service is provided "as is," free of charge, without warranties. We may
    modify, suspend, or discontinue features with reasonable notice where
    practical.
  </p>

  <h2>Termination</h2>
  <p>
    We may suspend accounts that violate these terms. You can end these terms
    at any time by deleting your account from the
    <a href="/account">account page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="mailto:support@bukulatihan.app">support@bukulatihan.app</a>
  </p>
</Base>
